      "knowledge_point": "Evaluating a Vector-Valued Function",
      "problem": "Given that $r(t)=⟨6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t),\\,{sin}^{2}⁡(5t)⟩,$ calculate $r(\\frac{\\pi }{3}).$",
