      "knowledge_point": "Finding the Magnitude of a Vector-Valued Function",
      "problem": "Given that $r(t)=⟨3t-1,\\,2t⟩,$ $|r(3)|=$",
      "worked_solution": "Evaluating the function at $t=3,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(3) & =⟨3(3)-1,\\,2(3)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨8,\\,6⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the magnitude of this vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r(3)| & =\\sqrt{{(8)}^{2}+{(6)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{64+36} \\\\  & =10.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
